Package: RResult
Type: Package
Title: Live Interactive Inspection of R Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-14
Authors@R: person("Yuxuan", "He", email = "heyuxuan0525@outlook.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-1149-5554"))
Description: A local Shiny workspace for bounded, on-demand inspection of R
    objects, dense and sparse matrices, data frames, statistical models, tests,
    principal components, constrained ordinations, additive models, ROC curves,
    differential-expression results, clusters, and time series. Visual reports combine
    key metrics, interactive chart choices, and downloadable results. Object
    inspection, data providers, statistical adapters, and presentation are
    separated, with conservative handling of unfamiliar classes and bindings.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: shiny (>= 1.8.0), htmltools, ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), jsonlite, methods, stats, utils, grDevices, grid
Suggests: ggrepel
Enhances: Matrix, survival, lme4, nlme, MASS, lmerTest, emmeans,
    mgcv, DESeq2, S4Vectors,
    SeuratObject (>= 5.0.0), SummarizedExperiment, SingleCellExperiment,
    SpatialExperiment, edgeR, limma, DOSE
